    {
      "source": "Constructs a new <code>AbstractSubscription</code> instance. Allows channels and patterns to be added to the\nsubscription w/o triggering a subscription action (as some clients (Jedis) require an initial call before entering\ninto listening mode).",
      "translation": "构建一个新的<code>AbstractSubscription</code>实例。允许向订阅中添加通道和模式，而不会触发订阅操作（因为某些客户端（如 Jedis）在进入监听模式之前需要先进行一次初始调用）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
